**Finding:** HACC Pk-ratio (P_hydro/P_grav) at z=0 for the strongAGN point (kappa_w=3.0, e_w=1.0, M_seed=1.3, v_kin=1.2, eps_kin=1.2, omega_m=0.14, sigma_8=0.8) is 0.851 at k=5.25, 0.8205 at k=7.01, 0.7946 at k=10.01 and 0.7893 at k=12.55 h/Mpc (the last tabulated k). The curve flattens to a plateau of about 0.789-0.790 for k of about 11.6-12.6 h/Mpc, so there is no resolved upturn: the minimum is at or just beyond k_max of about 12.6 h/Mpc and has a depth of about 21%.
