[finding] f-018 The HACC Pk-ratio emulator k-grid (799 bins) runs from 0.022 to about 12.6 h/Mpc. That answers q-01: the grid reaches 10 h/Mpc but stops at about 12.6 h/Mpc, so
**Finding:** The HACC Pk-ratio emulator k-grid (799 bins) runs from 0.022 to about 12.6 h/Mpc. That answers q-01: the grid reaches 10 h/Mpc but stops at about 12.6 h/Mpc, so the high-k upturn seen in FLAMINGO and OWLS-type runs is not covered. For the strongAGN point the ratio is still decreasing slowly (by less than 0.001 per 0.1 h/Mpc) at the edge.
