[finding] f-019 At k of about 3.7 h/Mpc and z=0, the fiducial point (kappa_w=3, e_w=0.6, v_kin=0.65, eps_kin=0.61) has a Pk-ratio of 0.8984 (std 0.004), against 0.8909 for stro
**Finding:** At k of about 3.7 h/Mpc and z=0, the fiducial point (kappa_w=3, e_w=0.6, v_kin=0.65, eps_kin=0.61) has a Pk-ratio of 0.8984 (std 0.004), against 0.8909 for strongAGN. At k=1.01 the values are 0.9779 (fiducial) and 0.9746 (strongAGN), and at k=3.01 they are 0.9197 and 0.9121. Strong kinetic feedback therefore deepens the suppression by only about 0.3-0.8 percentage points over k=1-3.7 h/Mpc.
