[finding] f-025 Answers q-07. Preston, Amon and Efstathiou (arXiv:2305.09827, Eq. 3) find that Planck LCDM is compatible with DES Y3 cosmic shear if non-linear power is suppres
**Finding:** Answers q-07. Preston, Amon and Efstathiou (arXiv:2305.09827, Eq. 3) find that Planck LCDM is compatible with DES Y3 cosmic shear if non-linear power is suppressed with A_mod = 0.858 +/- 0.052 (no scale cuts, Planck prior on S8 and Omega_m). This is a weaker suppression than the KiDS-1000 value A_mod ≈ 0.69 from Paper I (arXiv:2206.11794).
