**Completed — Read the HACC outputs already written but never read (fGas for fiducial, strongAGN and weakAGN; maxsupp_lowkin_z0; maxsupp_lowM_z0; fiducial_z1). Pair f_gas near M500c ~ 1e14 Msun with S(k=1) and S(k=3) to test the van Daalen-type relation, and establish whether the design range can reach the eROSITA+kSZ level..** Direction partly met. The f_gas values and the two maxsupp variants were read; the weakAGN pairing and the fiducial z=0 vs z=1 comparison were not. (1) fGas at z=0 (f-033), in the bin nearest 1e14 Msun/h (M500c = 1.26e14 Msun/h): fiducial 0.1214+/-0.0010, strongAGN 0.1221+/-0.0019, weakAGN 0.1414+/-0.0023. (2) Gas-fraction vs suppression (f-034): this pairing is not met. Only 2 points have S(k) values (fiducial: S(k=1)=0.9779, S(k=3)=0.9197; strongAGN: 0.9746, 0.9121). Their f_gas values agree within errors, and strongAGN is nominally higher despite its deeper suppression, so this pair shows no van Daalen-type relation. The comparison is also confounded, because e_w changes together with the kinetic parameters. The weakAGN S(k) was not read, so the 3-point test is still open. (3) maxsupp_lowkin (v_kin=0.1, eps_kin=0.02) shows essentially no suppression: S = 1.0006+/-0.0019 at k=1.013, 0.9972+/-0.0062 at k=3.007 and 0.9883 at k=3.70 h/Mpc. The kinetic parameters therefore drive the suppression (f-035). (4) maxsupp_lowM (M_seed=0.6) is stronger than maxsupp: S = 0.9967 at k=0.21, 0.9835 at k=0.51, 0.9557+/-0.0029 at k=1.013, 0.9026 at k=2.0, 0.8521+/-0.0094 at k=3.007 and 0.8228+/-0.0109 at k=3.70 h/Mpc. That is 4.4% suppression at k=1 and 14.8% at k=3 (f-036). (5) Of the points read, none reaches the eROSITA+kSZ level of 10+/-2% at k=1. The strongest, lowM, falls short by about 2.8 sigma; it is consistent with HSC-XXL and with Grandis et al. at k=1, but 3.6 points low at k=3. (6) Not done (q-16): fiducial_z1 at k=1 and k=3, weakAGN S(k), and a verbatim quote of the k~12.5 rows for f-018. Files: runs/261023_143127/fgas_{fiducial,strong,weak}/fGas_z0.0000_prediction.csv, maxsupp_lowkin_z0/ and maxsupp_lowM_z0/Pk-ratio_z0.0000_prediction.csv. No figures were produced.
